([10:31 AM] REYNOLDS: Did you hear the basement motion alarm at 10:15 PM?) Tj T*
([10:31 AM] VANCE: The motion alarm never sounded in the booth. The control) Tj T*
(panel showed green all night.) Tj T*
([10:32 AM] REYNOLDS: Did anyone visit the estate during your watch?) Tj T*
([10:32 AM] VANCE: The courier van from Apex Deliveries arrived at 9:50 PM) Tj T*
(with conservatory plants, and drove off at 10:30 PM.) Tj T*
([10:33 AM] REYNOLDS: Did you leave your desk at all?) Tj T*
([10:33 AM] VANCE: I remained at the security console continuously from 7:00) Tj T*
(PM to midnight without leaving.) Tj T*
